    <sec id="sec_1" sec-type="scope">
      <label>1</label>
      <title>范围</title>
      <p>本文件规定了骨架样例的内容，参见<xref ref-type="app" rid="sec_A">附录A</xref>。</p>
      <p>格式有<bold>粗体</bold>、<italic>斜体</italic>、<underline>下划线</underline>和<strike>删除线</strike>；变量<named-content content-type="variable">x<sup>2</sup></named-content>，调用<inline-code>init(&amp;ctx)</inline-code>。</p>
    </sec>
    <sec id="sec_2" sec-type="norm-refs">
