          <disp-quote>
            <p>被缩进的单段引文。</p>
          </disp-quote>
          <code>for (i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {
    total += a[i];
}</code>
        </sec>
        <non-normative-note>
          <label>注：</label>
          <p>子条之后的尾部注：写在子条之后。</p>
        </non-normative-note>
